    "title": "Tiger Woods' girlfriend Vanessa Trump, her daughter Kai Trump not in golfer's car in Florida crash: sources",
    "text": "Tiger Woods’ girlfriend Vanessa Trump and her two daughters Kai and Chloe were not in the golf legend’s luxury SUV when it rolled over in a two-car crash in Florida on Friday afternoon, sources said. Follow The Post’s live coverage on Tiger Woods’ rollover car crash in Florida The beleaguered sports superstar was driving solo when he crashed, leading to a DUI charge against him just days after he competed in the TGL Finals in Palm Beach, where he and the former daughter-in-law of President Trump were seen embracing. Also on hand for the tournament were Kai Trump, 18, and Chloe Trump, 11, whom Vanessa shares with ex-husband Donald Trump Jr. Both mother and daughters were seen cheering for Woods in his long-awaited return to competition. Tiger Woods’ girlfriend Vanessa Trump and her daughter Kai Trump were not in the golf legend’s car when it rolled over in a two-car crash in Florida Friday afternoon, sources said. GREG LOVETT/PALM BEACH POST / USA TODAY NETWORK via Imagn Images But Woods appeared to be “OK,” a witness told TMZ. Shabba / BACKGRID Vanessa, 48, who filed for divorce from Trump Jr. in 2018 and shares five children with, has been with Woods for more than a year. The couple hard-launched their relationship last March in a heartfelt social media post after news of their romance started spreading weeks earlier. “Love is in the air and life is better with you by my side! We look forward to our journey through life together. At this time we would appreciate privacy to all those close to our hearts,” Woods posted on social media. They started dating under the radar after a friendship grew into something more, a source said at the time. Woods appeared to be “OK,” a witness told TMZ. Getty Images Woods, 50, was originally hesitant to go beyond a friendship with Vanessa because the 15-time major winner is buddies with President Trump. But Trump has been on board with the relationship, saying last March that he was “happy for both” of them. Skidmarks and debris show where Woods crashed his vehicle on Friday. Shabba / BACKGRID He said that Woods called him a few months ago about the budding romance. “He told me about it and I said, ‘Tiger, that’s good.’ I’m very happy for both [of them]. Just let them both be happy,” the GOP leader said. Kai, one of President Trump’s 11 grandchildren, is an impressive golfer in her own right. Follow The Post’s latest updates on Tiger Woods’ Florida car crash Tiger Woods’ status for 2026 Masters revealed after DUI arrest Paige Spiranac ‘rooting’ for Tiger Woods as golf icon seeks treatment after DUI arrest PGA Tour takes Tiger Woods stand as Masters questions linger after DUI arrest Tiger Woods could face jail in his new DUI case — here’s what’s next, according to defense lawyers She is a rising amateur player and has already committed to compete for the University of Miami when she starts college next fall. Earlier this year, she revealed she underwent a successful surgery to her left wrist. “I look forward to my rehab in the coming months,” she wrote on social media in January. “I am excited for the ability to play golf pain-free!” Woods was arrested for DUI following the crash. Shabba / BACKGRID Both Vanessa and Kai have attended a number of recent golf events with Woods leading up to the TGL Finals, which took place inside SoFi Center. The trio posed for photos together at the 2026 Genesis Invitational last month. Woods is now facing his latest legal drama for allegedly driving under the influence of some type of medication or drug, said Martin County Sheriff John Budensiek at a Friday afternoon news conference. The top cop also noted that Woods was “lethargic” at the time of the arrest. The golf legend was forced to crawl out of his overturned SUV at the scene, which is about three miles from Jupiter Island, where he has lived for several years. Woods, who suffered an assortment of golf injuries over the years — as well as a series of other crashes, was not injured in the cras